{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ground_state_ordering","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ground_state_ordering","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ground_state_ordering","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ground_state_ordering","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/ground_state_ordering.lean#L44-L77","doc":"**REFUTED — retained only as the historical statement** (bean `qou-48is`,\n    2026-08-09).  The two ordering conjuncts below are **false**: an\n    exhaustive `Φ_q` sweep over every `C(A,Z)` arrangement for `A ≤ 16` at\n    the experimental (proton) anchor shows the interleaved + tail-packed\n    arrangement is not the minimiser for `A ≥ 4` (it is the strict\n    *maximiser* at `A = 5, Z = 1`), and the `A ≤ 3` conjunct fails as stated\n    at `A = 2`.  The counterexample is proved sorry-free, for an interval of\n    `q` containing the anchor, in\n    `QOU.MassTheory.GroundStateOrderingRefutation.prescribed_not_minimiser_A5`;\n    the third conjunct (`λ₊ · λ₋ = -1`) survives and is proved there as\n    `transferEigen_vieta`.  This `def` names the historical claim and is not\n    asserted; **do not** attempt to discharge it.  See\n    `docs/audits/2026-08-09-ground-state-ordering-truth-value.md`.\n\n    **Original proposition statement** (from manuscript):\n\nThe nuclear ground state ordering for a nucleus with $Z$ protons\nand $N$ neutrons ($A = Z + N$) is determined by:*\n\n    The Lean encoding **names** the conditional conjecture as a `Prop`\n    (pattern C of the vacuity-fix playbook): the context class is the\n    carrier of the transfer-matrix / ordering data, and\n    `ground_state_ordering` is the proposition that interleaving,\n    boundary correction, and the Vieta eigenvalue product hold for that\n    data.  It is *not* asserted (no `theorem … := ⟨ctx.claim_*⟩`\n    self-assuming projection); a discharging instance is the open\n    conditional claim. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.ordering","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.ordering","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/ground_state_ordering.lean#L42-L42","doc":"The ground-state ordering at position `k`: `1` = proton,\n`0` = neutron. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.lam_minus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.lam_minus","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/ground_state_ordering.lean#L39-L39","doc":"Transfer-matrix subdominant eigenvalue (`T_pp`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.lam_plus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.lam_plus","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/ground_state_ordering.lean#L37-L37","doc":"Transfer-matrix dominant eigenvalue (`T_pp`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.q","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/ground_state_ordering.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Substrate parameter `q`, in the generic base ring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.A_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.A_eq","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/ground_state_ordering.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.A","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/ground_state_ordering.lean#L32-L32","doc":"Mass number `A = Z + N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.N","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/ground_state_ordering.lean#L30-L30","doc":"Neutron number `N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.Z","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/ground_state_ordering.lean#L28-L28","doc":"Proton number `Z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/ground_state_ordering.lean#L26-L26","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.GroundStateOrderingContext","kind":"class","line":15,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/ground_state_ordering.lean#L15-L42","doc":"Abstract context for the `ground_state_ordering` claim —\nmanuscript-themed typed fields below; the ground-state ordering\nis selected by the transfer-matrix eigenvalues `λ_±` and the\nZ, N counts.\n\n§7c base ring: the claim's only arithmetic is the Vieta product\n`λ₊ · λ₋ = -1`, which needs a `Ring` and nothing more — no\nordering on the eigenvalues, no square root, no archimedean\nconstruct. The `Z ≤ N`, `4 ≤ A`, `A ≤ 3` comparisons are over\n`ℕ`, not over the eigenvalue carrier. The carrier is therefore a\ntype variable `R`; the archimedean realisation is `R := ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}